**依据 2 · 源码核查**：[dsh-mneme/src/service.js:1189-1236](https://github.com/slow-stack/mneme/blob/35a79c1108cc59b01c86410a85a40e09164d6efd/dsh-mneme/src/service.js#L1189-L1236)

